  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Oct 29, 2026 at 02:11 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Hyderabad: <a href=\"/tag/apollo+hospitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apollo Hospitals</a> has launched an <a href=\"/tag/ai-assisted+stroke+care\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AI-assisted stroke care</a> programme on World Stroke Day, emphasising the importance of <a href=\"/tag/timely+diagnosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">timely diagnosis</a>, emergency intervention and coordinated treatment to improve patient outcomes.\"The 360 degree stroke care programme integrates emergency assessment, advanced <a href=\"/tag/neuro-intensive+care\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">neuro-intensive care</a>, rehabilitation and home-based follow-up to provide patients with a connected pathway to recovery,\" said Dr Suresh Girgani, Consultant Neurointerventional Radiologist, Apollo Hospitals.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>It incorporates advanced neuro-ICU monitoring and MRI-integrated operating theatre capabilities, where applicable, to support specialised treatment. </p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>“The emergency and intervention services include 5G-connected ambulances, rapid stroke assessment, clot-busting treatment through thrombolysis and mechanical thrombectomy for eligible patients, including selected cases up to 24 hours from symptom onset,” Dr. Sandeep Nayani, Consultant Neurologist, explained.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The hospital highlighted the importance of recognising stroke symptoms early and seeking immediate medical attention, as timely treatment can significantly influence recovery.It urged the public to treat stroke as a medical emergency and seek immediate assistance through its stroke emergency helpline, 1066.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 29, 2026 at 02:11 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 29, 2026 at 02:11 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-play.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"App Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-app-store.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                        </div>    -->\n                         \n                \n                                    <figure>\n                        <!-- <i></i>\n                        <span class=\"scan-t